This document shows the kaodiss template for Typst. It reproduces the layout of
the kaobook LaTeX class: a wide outer margin holds sidenotes, figure captions
and a small table of contents at the beginning of every chapter. The
measurements of page, type and spacing are taken from kaobook.

Replace this text with the abstract of your dissertation. The abstract, the
abstract in a second language and the acknowledgements are set in the wide layout without a
margin column, like the rest of the front matter.
